Package: arp-vendor-lookup
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Romeo Reynolds <romeoreynolds@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/romeoreynolds/arp-vendor-lookup
Description: resolve MAC addresses in ARP tables to hardware vendors
 Paste ARP output from Windows, Linux, macOS, Cisco IOS, Palo Alto PAN-OS,
 Fortinet or Juniper and get a clean IP / MAC / vendor list.
 .
 Vendor names come from the IEEE OUI registries bundled with the package,
 so lookups work offline and MAC addresses never leave the machine.
 Includes a Tk GUI (arpvendor-gui) and a CLI (arpvendor) with table,
 CSV and JSON output.
